From ab2cfd4c0fe4a04ea0c374ae4538e2094f66cf74 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andrew Youll <andrewyoull86@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 11:48:02 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 04/11] avdevice: egl output device (RISC OS, riscos-mesa EGL)

ffmpeg -re -i clip -f egl title: frames are converted and scaled by
swscale straight into a locked EGL window surface (EGL_KHR_lock_surface)
and shown with eglSwapBuffers, in a Wimp window of its own, an existing
window, or full screen (optionally straight into screen memory).
--enable-riscos-egl.
---
 configure                |   5 +
 libavdevice/Makefile     |   1 +
 libavdevice/alldevices.c |   1 +
 libavdevice/riscos_egl.c | 477 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 484 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 libavdevice/riscos_egl.c

